# .dockerignore for the commit-image build (mayhem/Dockerfile).
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo (including .git history — the grader uses it), dropping only local
# build artifacts and editor/OS cruft. Dev image, not minimal.
#
# Additive file — upstream lunasvg ships no .dockerignore of its own.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# mayhem/build.sh builds into build-fuzz/ and build-oracle/ at build time inside the image; keep
# them (and upstream's own /build, already in upstream .gitignore) out of the build CONTEXT.
build/
build-fuzz/
build-oracle/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
